silm:instances_papers_11_base_commutative_diagram_chapters_26_circuit_imprint_tensor_sections_01_three_axes_unpacked_concrete_anchor_1#scopeaxis_individual silm:hasLongDescription "The ScopeAxis_individual is the individual pole of the scope axis: \"this specific cat Mittens at vet visit F11-2026\" -- ONE individual, not a class. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'ScopeAxis_individual', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
